Basic Functions
1.length() → returns number of characters
2.isEmpty() → checks if string is empty
3,isBlank() → checks if string has only spaces

Character Access
charAt() → returns character at given index

Searching
indexOf() → returns first occurrence index
lastIndexOf() → returns last occurrence index
contains() → checks if substring exists

Substring
substring() → extracts part of string
subSequence() → returns subsequence

Case Conversion
toUpperCase() → converts to uppercase
toLowerCase() → converts to lowercase

Comparison
equals() → checks content equality
equalsIgnoreCase() → compares ignoring case
compareTo() → compares lexicographically
compareToIgnoreCase() → compares ignoring case

Concatenation
concat() → joins two strings

Trimming
trim() → removes leading & trailing spaces
strip() → removes spaces (Unicode aware)
stripLeading() → removes leading spaces
stripTrailing() → removes trailing spaces

Replace
replace() → replaces characters/strings
replaceAll() → replaces using regex
replaceFirst() → replaces first match

Split & Join
split() → splits string into array
join() → joins elements with delimiter

Conversion
toCharArray() → converts to char array
getBytes() → converts to byte array
valueOf() → converts other types to string

Start/End Check
startsWith() → checks starting prefix
endsWith() → checks ending suffix

Matching
matches() → checks regex match

Advanced (Java 11+)
repeat() → repeats string
lines() → returns stream of lines
indent() → adds indentation
transform() → applies function

Static Methods
format() → formats string
copyValueOf() → converts char array to string
intern() → returns canonical representation
